# Thesis-writing scratch space — chapter outlines, figure drafts, internal
# specs handed off between Claude sessions. Local-only by design; never
# meant to ship in the repo or the installer. PyInstaller's datas list
# already excludes the repo-root `documentation/` directory; this guard
# prevents an accidental `git add -A` from a future session uploading it.
documentation/
